WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.200
What happens when you place a DVD box&nbsp;
set of The Office into the Clockworks?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.280
Dr. Rodrigeuz selected a complete DVD box set&nbsp;
of the sitcom The Office (US Version), and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.680
placed it into SCP-914 on the setting "Fine." The&nbsp;
output was a mosaic portrait of Dwight Schrute,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:23.040
made from DVD fragments. Dr. Rodriguez has&nbsp;
since hung this portrait up in his office.

